[break] a-programs-time-outlasts-its-call
rule: A program's time is never longer than its call has left.
file: crates/cineris-ext/src/host.rs
in: serve
find: timeout: asked.min(time_left)
replace: timeout: asked
caught-by:
    cineris-ext::it serve::a_programs_time_is_never_longer_than_the_call_has_left

[break] programs-reach-the-network-unasked
rule: A program an extension runs reaches the network only when its manifest says `exec_network`.
